WEBVTT

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.430
Psst! You're on! Go!

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.030
Whoo! Let's party!

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.710
Let's dance! Whoo!

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.110
Hey, a party.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.710
Bark, bark, bark!

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:17.710
-Joy, this isn't working.
-(FABRIC RIPS)

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.550
BING BONG: Huh!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.870
-(CRASHING)
-(FABRIC RIPS)

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.550
Huh? Sadness, what are you doing?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.990
-Come back here!
-(DOG BARKING)

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.790
It's just a dream,
it's just a dream. It's just a dream.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:35.070
They're trying to wake her up.
Call security!

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:37.670
Hi, Riley, it's me!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:39.310
-BING BONG: ♪ Who's your friend
-Bing Bong?

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.710
♪ Who likes to play?
Bing Bong, Bing Bong! ♪

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.390
JOY: Sadness, stop! It was working!

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:43.510
BING BONG: Ow.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.430
Sadness! You are ruining this dream!
You're scaring her!

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.590
But look, it's working!

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:49.870
Whoa.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:51.710
They are not
part of this dream. Get them!

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:54.150
SECURITY: Stop right there!
BING BONG: Ow!

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:56.630
Pan away! Pan away!

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.270
(NEIGHS)

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:03.070
Boo! Pick a plotline!

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.910
-Ow! Careful!
-GUARD: Hold still!

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:06.270
BING BONG: You can't do this!

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.270
BING BONG:
I know people in Headquarters!

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.550
BING BONG: Ow! Cut that out!
Ow! Please!

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:15.670
Do you like candy? You look hungry.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:17.830
I get you candy! Oh no!

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:19.630
JOY: No, no. No, no!

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.750
There go the Core Memories!

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:23.670
BING BONG: I can't go in there!
I'm scared of the dark!

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.870
Please!

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:26.150
Oh, come on.

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:29.510
JOY: What is this place?

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:30.790
SADNESS: The Subconscious.

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:32.910
It's where they take
all the troublemakers.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:39.110
My hat feels loose.

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:40.430
Mmm. How do we get in?

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:41.590
GUARD 1: Let me see.

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:43.110
GUARD 2: You got my hat?
Or is that your hat?

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:44.910
GUARD 1: Yeah, it's my hat.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.030
GUARD 2: You sure? I don’t know,
look in the label.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:49.350
-Yeah, it says, "My hat."
-Wait, it says, "My hat"?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:51.230
-My hat, it says.
-That's what I wrote in my hat.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:52.630
-What are you talking about?
-You've got my hat on.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.230
-Okay, but it's my handwriting.
-(THUDDING)

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.750
-Hey! You!
-Oh! You caught us!

00:01:57.990 --> 00:01:59.190
GUARD 1: Get back in there!

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.790
GUARD 1: No escaping!

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:04.470
(HOWLING)

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:05.990
(SADNESS WHIMPERING)

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:11.190
I don't like it here.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.190
It's where they keep
Riley's darkest fears.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.310
(GASPS)

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:17.990
It's broccoli.

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:19.910
-(DOOR CREAKING)
-(BOTH GASP)

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.230
SADNESS: The stairs to the basement!

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:23.430
(BOTH YELP)

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:24.710
(WHIRRING)

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.350
JOY: Grandma's vacuum cleaner!

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.070
(BOTH SCREAMING)

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.230
Okay, come on.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:37.990
(FOOTSTEPS CRUNCHING)

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:39.150
Would you walk quieter?

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:40.230
I'm trying.

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:41.670
What is going...

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:45.910
Candy wrappers? (GASPS)

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.390
(BING BONG CRYING)

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.910
-JOY: Bing Bong!
-Joy?

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:00.270
-There you are.
-Shhh!

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.630
-(SNORING)
-(BOTH GASP)

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.630
It's Jangles.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:09.710
Who's the birthday girl?
Who's the birthday girl?

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:23.350
Do you have the Core Memories?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:24.870
Yeah.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.990
All he cared about was the candy!

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:29.190
Shh.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.630
(SQUEAKING)

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.030
(JOY GRUNTING)

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.190
(CONTINUES SNORING)

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.070
We're out of here! Let's get to that train!

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.910
Wait! The train's not running.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.750
We still have to wake up Riley.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:52.910
But how?

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.710
(SNORING CONTINUES)

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.150
Oh, no!

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.550
(SQUEAKS)

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.510
(JANGLES GROANS)

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:16.270
Hey, Sadness.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.670
(STAMMERING) Did you hear
about the pa-pa-party they were having?

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.510
Oh, yeah. Oh, yes, Joy.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:24.230
(STUTTERING) Isn't it a birthday party?

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:25.630
Did you say

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.430
birthday? (LAUGHS)

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.470
And there's going to be
cake and presents.

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:30.710
And games and balloons...

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.150
A birthday?

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:33.950
Okay. Follow us!

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:35.470
(JANGLES LAUGHING)

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:38.070
Nothing like a good scare
to wake you up, right?

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.550
Okay, but it's my handwriting.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.190
No it isn't. That's my... I wrote that.

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:42.350
No, but this one's my handwriting.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.630
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.430
(JANGLES LAUGHING)

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.830
(SILLY MUSIC PLAYING)

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.150
(CRASHING)

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.910
Who's the birthday girl?

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:04.990
(SHRIEKS)

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:07.350
(GASPING)

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:08.550
(BELL DINGS)

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:10.190
-Whoo-hoo!
-Come on, let's go!

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:12.830
(TRAIN HONKING HORN)

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.150
JOY: Ha-ha! We made it!

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:22.070
Guess who's on their way
to Headquarters!

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:23.430
SADNESS: We are!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.230
BING BONG: Whoo-hoo!
JOY: Whoo!

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:26.630
(ALL WHOOPING)

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.950
-What is going on?
-He did it again!

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.510
We were at school, and we were
naked, and there was a dog,

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.870
and his back half was chasing him
and then we saw Bing Bong!

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:41.030
You idiot! It was a dream!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.270
This is ridiculous!

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.270
We can't even get
a good night's sleep anymore.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.390
Time to take action.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:49.190
Stupid Mom and Dad.
If they hadn't moved us,

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:50.550
none of this would've happened.

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.150
Who's with me?

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:53.870
(STUTTERING) Um...

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:55.390
No no no no no.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.310
(SIGHS) Yeah. Let's do it.

